  "captions": [
    {
      "id": "c1",
      "start": 0.78,
      "end": 2.24,
      "text": "In June, federal,"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2",
      "start": 2.28,
      "end": 4.51,
      "text": "state and local agencies flew drones"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3",
      "start": 4.55,
      "end": 6.71,
      "text": "at a demonstration in Jim Wells County,"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4",
      "start": 6.75,
      "end": 7.66,
      "text": "South Texas."
    },
    {
      "id": "c5",
      "start": 7.78,
      "end": 9.79,
      "text": "They were hunting a flesh-eating fly"
    },
    {
      "id": "c6",
      "start": 9.83,
      "end": 11.7,
      "text": "that is moving north over the border."
    },
    {
      "id": "c7",
      "start": 12.3,
      "end": 13.78,
      "text": "The idea is simple."
    },
    {
      "id": "c8",
      "start": 14.06,
      "end": 16.03,
      "text": "Drones, cameras and artificial"
    },
    {
      "id": "c9",
      "start": 16.07,
      "end": 17.6,
      "text": "intelligence could spot an injured"
    },
    {
      "id": "c10",
      "start": 17.64,
      "end": 19.33,
      "text": "or infested animal in country"
    },
    {
      "id": "c11",
      "start": 19.37,
      "end": 20.84,
      "text": "too rough to ride into."
    },
    {
      "id": "c12",
      "start": 21.02,
      "end": 21.9,
      "text": "That is what the"
    },
    {
      "id": "c13",
      "start": 21.94,
      "end": 23.42,
      "text": "demonstration set out to show."
    },
    {
      "id": "c14",
      "start": 24.26,
      "end": 25.68,
      "text": "Michael Schmoyer of the"
    },
    {
      "id": "c15",
      "start": 25.72,
      "end": 27.35,
      "text": "USDA's animal health agency"
    },
    {
      "id": "c16",
      "start": 27.39,
      "end": 28.56,
      "text": "said the tools already"
    },
    {
      "id": "c17",
      "start": 28.6,
      "end": 30.22,
      "text": "work well on feral hogs."
    },
    {
      "id": "c18",
      "start": 30.28,
      "end": 31.71,
      "text": "So the question was whether"
    },
    {
      "id": "c19",
      "start": 31.75,
      "end": 33.6,
      "text": "they could work on screwworm too."
    },
    {
      "id": "c20",
      "start": 34.53,
      "end": 35.72,
      "text": "Spotters in the air and on"
    },
    {
      "id": "c21",
      "start": 35.76,
      "end": 37.64,
      "text": "the ground will rely on cameras,"
    },
    {
      "id": "c22",
      "start": 37.72,
      "end": 39.17,
      "text": "infrared, night vision,"
    },
    {
      "id": "c23",
      "start": 39.21,
      "end": 41.3,
      "text": "heat sensors, dogs and AI."
    },
    {
      "id": "c24",
      "start": 41.48,
      "end": 43.36,
      "text": "When a hide shows an open wound,"
    },
    {
      "id": "c25",
      "start": 43.4,
      "end": 45.14,
      "text": "the technology takes a closer look"
    },
    {
      "id": "c26",
      "start": 45.18,
      "end": 46.7,
      "text": "to see if the fly is attacking."
    },
    {
      "id": "c27",
      "start": 47.98,
      "end": 48.845,
      "text": "John Bellinger,"
    },
    {
      "id": "c28",
      "start": 48.885,
      "end": 51.16,
      "text": "a lead advisor to the Agriculture Secretary,"
    },
    {
      "id": "c29",
      "start": 51.2,
      "end": 52.42,
      "text": "has seen it before."
    },
    {
      "id": "c30",
      "start": 52.5,
      "end": 54.46,
      "text": "He treated screwworm on calves at"
    },
    {
      "id": "c31",
      "start": 54.5,
      "end": 56.54,
      "text": "his grandfather's place in Wilson County."
    },
    {
      "id": "c32",
      "start": 56.62,
      "end": 58.95,
      "text": "At the demonstration, he said it's back,"
    },
    {
      "id": "c33",
      "start": 58.99,
      "end": 60.86,
      "text": "and the country has to solve it."
    },
    {
      "id": "c34",
      "start": 61.86,
      "end": 63.12,
      "text": "Spectrum News reported"
    },
    {
      "id": "c35",
      "start": 63.16,
      "end": 64.6,
      "text": "infected cases in Zavala,"
    },
    {
      "id": "c36",
      "start": 64.82,
      "end": 66.5,
      "text": "La Salle and Gillespie counties."
    },
    {
      "id": "c37",
      "start": 66.64,
      "end": 69.34,
      "text": "The animals were cattle, a goat and a dog."
    },
    {
      "id": "c38",
      "start": 70.54,
      "end": 72.1,
      "text": "Bellinger called wildlife one"
    },
    {
      "id": "c39",
      "start": 72.14,
      "end": 73.32,
      "text": "of the biggest challenges."
    },
    {
      "id": "c40",
      "start": 73.58,
      "end": 75.77,
      "text": "White-tailed deer and feral hogs can become"
    },
    {
      "id": "c41",
      "start": 75.81,
      "end": 77.72,
      "text": "hosts without anyone knowing they were hurt."
    },
    {
      "id": "c42",
      "start": 78.68,
      "end": 80.29,
      "text": "So officials call technology"
    },
    {
      "id": "c43",
      "start": 80.33,
      "end": 81.52,
      "text": "one part of the plan."
    },
    {
      "id": "c44",
      "start": 81.56,
      "end": 83.4,
      "text": "The most effective weapon, they say,"
    },
    {
      "id": "c45",
      "start": 83.44,
      "end": 85.32,
      "text": "is still the sterile fly program."
    },
    {
      "id": "c46",
      "start": 86.54,
      "end": 87.92,
      "text": "Bellinger said the country needs"
    },
    {
      "id": "c47",
      "start": 87.96,
      "end": 90.57,
      "text": "400 million sterile flies in 2027."
    },
    {
      "id": "c48",
      "start": 90.96,
      "end": 91.84,
      "text": "As of June,"
    },
    {
      "id": "c49",
      "start": 91.88,
      "end": 93.5,
      "text": "a sterile fly plant in Edinburg"
    },
    {
      "id": "c50",
      "start": 93.54,
      "end": 95.48,
      "text": "was expected to open early that year."
    },
    {
      "id": "c51",
      "start": 96.46,
      "end": 97.66,
      "text": "USDA has help from"
    },
    {
      "id": "c52",
      "start": 97.7,
      "end": 99.06,
      "text": "Customs and Border Protection."
    },
    {
      "id": "c53",
      "start": 99.45,
      "end": 101.65,
      "text": "KRGV reported that the drones use AI"
    },
    {
      "id": "c54",
      "start": 101.69,
      "end": 103.6,
      "text": "to flag animals that may be infected."
    },
    {
      "id": "c55",
      "start": 104.34,
      "end": 105.2,
      "text": "For now,"
    },
    {
      "id": "c56",
      "start": 105.24,
      "end": 107.01,
      "text": "producers are urged to inspect their animals"
    },
    {
      "id": "c57",
      "start": 107.05,
      "end": 109.34,
      "text": "more often and report any suspected case."
    },
    {
      "id": "c58",
      "start": 109.98,
      "end": 111.32,
      "text": "The drone can point."
    },
    {
      "id": "c59",
      "start": 111.66,
      "end": 113.5,
      "text": "Somebody still has to walk out and look."
    }
  ],
